<programme start="20261103111400 +0000" stop="20261103120000 +0000" channel="AMC+ 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">True Crime Story</title><sub-title lang="en">It Couldn&apos;t Happen Here: Adel, Georgia</sub-title><desc lang="en">The town of Adel, Ga., is rocked by a brutal robbery homicide, and locals quickly point to an outsider as the killer; over 20 years later, new evidence raises the startling question if an innocent man is serving life for another man&apos;s crime.</desc><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p20427808_b_v12_am.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261103120000 +0000" stop="20261103124400 +0000" channel="AMC+ 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">True Crime Story</title><sub-title lang="en">It Couldn&apos;t Happen Here: Sauquoit, New York</sub-title><desc lang="en">When a beloved chiropractor in Sauquoit, N.Y., dies suddenly under strange circumstances, investigators discover she&apos;s been murdered with a rare poison; the killer could only be someone she knew closely, and the case divides the town.</desc><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p20427808_b_v12_am.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261103124400 +0000" stop="20261103132800 +0000" channel="AMC+ 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">True Crime Story</title><sub-title lang="en">It Couldn&apos;t Happen Here: St. Augustine, Florida</sub-title><desc lang="en">A young woman in St. Augustine, Fla., with everything to live for is found shot to death with the gun belonging to her boyfriend, a deputy sheriff; he says it was suicide, but her family believes it was murder.</desc><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p20427808_b_v12_am.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261103132800 +0000" stop="20261103141200 +0000" channel="AMC+ 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">True Crime Story</title><sub-title lang="en">It Couldn&apos;t Happen Here: Cookeville, Tennessee</sub-title><desc lang="en">When an immigrant couple who settled in the Tennessee town of Cookeville is executed in their sleep and their house set on fire, investigators identify a suspect with motive; in their rush to make an arrest, they may have gotten the wrong man.</desc><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p20427808_b_v12_am.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261103141200 +0000" stop="20261103145500 +0000" channel="AMC+ 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">True Crime Story</title><sub-title lang="en">It Couldn&apos;t Happen Here: Shelbyville, Kentucky</sub-title><desc lang="en">In rural Shelbyville, Ky., a body is found in the river; years go by until the police catch the killer, but some in town question if the suspect is even capable of committing the crime.</desc><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p20427808_b_v12_am.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261103145500 +0000" stop="20261103153900 +0000" channel="AMC+ 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">True Crime Story</title><sub-title lang="en">Rockville / Ellington, Connecticut</sub-title><desc lang="en">When a 22-year-old dancer goes missing, the men of the neighboring town who frequented the club she worked at become the suspect pool; wealth and status may protect a killer; a determined police officer works the case.</desc><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p20427808_b_v12_am.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261103153900 +0000" stop="20261103162200 +0000" channel="AMC+ 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">True Crime Story</title><sub-title lang="en">It Couldn&apos;t Happen Here: Dallas, Ga.</sub-title><desc lang="en">In this true-crime story, after a woman is found shot in her bathroom, officials launch a death investigation to determine if it was suicide -- as her husband claimed -- or murder; years later, the case remains open, and the town still has questions.</desc><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p20427808_b_v12_am.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261103162200 +0000" stop="20261103170500 +0000" channel="AMC+ 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">True Crime Story</title><sub-title lang="en">It Couldn&apos;t Happen Here: Pocomoke City, Md.</sub-title><desc lang="en">In this true-crime story, a young single mother disappears without a trace; an investigation suggests she abandoned her children, while her family spends years proving she was murdered and finding her killers.</desc><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p20427808_b_v12_am.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261103170500 +0000" stop="20261103174800 +0000" channel="AMC+ 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">True Crime Story</title><sub-title lang="en">It Couldn&apos;t Happen Here: Angier, N.C.</sub-title><desc lang="en">In this true crime story, a man claims he shot his daughter&apos;s estranged husband, Christian Griggs, in self-defense -- but after investigators close the case, Christian&apos;s family discovers evidence that the killing was not justified.</desc><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p20427808_b_v12_am.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261103174800 +0000" stop="20261103183100 +0000" channel="AMC+ 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">True Crime Story</title><sub-title lang="en">It Couldn&apos;t Happen Here: Iaeger, W.Va.</sub-title><desc lang="en">In this true-crime story, a beloved town doctor perishes in a deadly house fire -- which investigators conclude was arson; but after securing a murder conviction, the prosecutor doubts his own evidence and joins the fight to free an innocent man.</desc><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p20427808_b_v12_am.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261103183100 +0000" stop="20261103191400 +0000" channel="AMC+ 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">True Crime Story</title><sub-title lang="en">It Couldn&apos;t Happen Here: Atwater, Ohio</sub-title><desc lang="en">In this true-crime story, cold-case investigators looking into a double murder elicit a series of confessions from a group of teens; years later, the teens recant their statements; aggressive tactics may have sent an innocent man to death row.</desc><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p20427808_b_v12_am.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261103191400 +0000" stop="20261103195700 +0000" channel="AMC+ 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">True Crime Story</title><sub-title lang="en">It Couldn&apos;t Happen Here: Turlock, California</sub-title><desc lang="en">A criminal defense attorney known for uncovering corruption finds himself on trial; accused of a complex murder-for-hire plot, along with eight others, he fights to clear his name and show the holes in the state&apos;s case.</desc><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p20427808_b_v12_am.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261103195700 +0000" stop="20261103204000 +0000" channel="AMC+ 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">True Crime Story</title><sub-title lang="en">It Couldn&apos;t Happen Here: Royse City, Texas</sub-title><desc lang="en">A couple are found brutally murdered in their home; investigators learn that the last person to see them alive had secrets of his own; some question whether prejudice led police to arrest the wrong man.</desc><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p20427808_b_v12_am.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261103204000 +0000" stop="20261103212300 +0000" channel="AMC+ 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">True Crime Story</title><sub-title lang="en">It Couldn&apos;t Happen Here: Edgewater, Florida</sub-title><desc lang="en">A dentist is killed by a masked gunman; the media reports salacious details as investigators uncover a sinister plot led by the dentist&apos;s wife and stepson, but a private investigator shares a startling alternate theory.</desc><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p20427808_b_v12_am.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261103212300 +0000" stop="20261103220600 +0000" channel="AMC+ 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">True Crime Story</title><sub-title lang="en">It Couldn&apos;t Happen Here: Benton, MO</sub-title><desc lang="en">After a teenage girl is found murdered in her car on the side of a highway, a stranger from out of town is convicted of her murder; when the deputy who originally discovered the body becomes sheriff, he calls everything into question.</desc><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p20427808_b_v12_am.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261103220600 +0000" stop="20261103224800 +0000" channel="AMC+ 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">True Crime Story</title><sub-title lang="en">It Couldn&apos;t Happen Here: Wahpeton, ND</sub-title><desc lang="en">When the body of a missing student is discovered in the river near a small college town, the community questions the role law enforcement may have played in his death.</desc><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p20427808_b_v12_am.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261103224800 +0000" stop="20261103233100 +0000" channel="AMC+ 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">True Crime Story</title><sub-title lang="en">It Couldn&apos;t Happen Here: New Albany, Mississippi</sub-title><desc lang="en">When a beloved member of a tight-knit community is killed, the town cries out for immediate justice; after a young man is sentenced to death for the crime, and an out-of-town lawyer argues they convicted an innocent man.</desc><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p20427808_b_v12_am.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261103233100 +0000" stop="20261104001400 +0000" channel="AMC+ 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">True Crime Story</title><sub-title lang="en">It Couldn&apos;t Happen Here: Prichard, Alabama</sub-title><desc lang="en">The murder of a gender-nonconforming Black teenager remains unsolved despite pressure from family and friends - raising issues about the increase of violence, and the lack of justice for trans murder victims across the country.</desc><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p20427808_b_v12_am.jpg"/></programme>
