<programme start="20261105080000 +0000" stop="20261105090000 +0000" channel="BBC Earth"><title lang="en">Planet Earth III</title><sub-title lang="en">Coasts</sub-title><desc lang="en">Sir David Attenborough explores the dangerous frontiers created by the world&apos;s coasts, where animals fight for survival amid constant change; there are some unexpected residents on Namibia&apos;s Skeleton Coast.</desc><category lang="en">Documentary</category><category lang="en">Animals</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p25873335_b_v12_aa.jpg"/></programme>
