<programme start="20261104220000 +0000" stop="20261104230000 +0000" channel="Crime + Investigation"><title lang="en">Cold Case Files: The Grim Sleeper</title><sub-title lang="en">Part 2</sub-title><desc lang="en">In the 1980s Los Angeles, a killer is terrorizing South Central, murdering African American women and discarding their bodies in the street; as the victim count rises, fear and anger take hold in a community often overlooked by the police.</desc><category lang="en">Specials</category><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p28502633_b_v12_aa.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261104230000 +0000" stop="20261105000000 +0000" channel="Crime + Investigation"><title lang="en">Cold Case Files</title><sub-title lang="en">Friday Night Ghosts</sub-title><desc lang="en">The bodies of five people abducted from a restaurant in 1983 are found in an oil field; the main suspect is long believed to be a well-connected local man, until evidence reveals the true killers had been hiding in plain sight for decades.</desc><category lang="en">Legal</category><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p13748348_b_v12_ae.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261105000000 +0000" stop="20261105010000 +0000" channel="Crime + Investigation"><title lang="en">Cold Case Files</title><sub-title lang="en">Murder by Moonlight</sub-title><desc lang="en">On Easter Sunday of 1992, the body of missing woman Lisa Ziegert is found in a field; the investigation yields many leads, but no true suspect; after more than two decades on ice, the case is revived when DNA phenotyping puts a face to the killer.</desc><category lang="en">Legal</category><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p13748348_b_v12_ae.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261105010000 +0000" stop="20261105020000 +0000" channel="Crime + Investigation"><title lang="en">Cold Case Files</title><sub-title lang="en">Written in Blood</sub-title><desc lang="en">In July 1970, the brutal murder of single mom Loretta Jones leaves 4-year-old Heidi Jones motherless; nearly 40 years later, Heidi vows to solve her mother&apos;s cold case and calls on an old high school friend to help her find justice for Loretta.</desc><category lang="en">Legal</category><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p13748348_b_v12_ae.jpg"/></programme>
