<programme start="20261103110000 +0000" stop="20261103130000 +0000" channel="SN1"><title lang="en">NBA Basketball</title><sub-title lang="en">Phoenix Suns at Golden State Warriors</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Golden State Warriors host the Phoenix Suns in an NBA regular-season game at Chase Center. Phoenix won the previous meeting 131-122 just two days ago and has taken three of the last five games in this series. Golden State relies on Stephen Curry.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Basketball</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191276_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261103130000 +0000" stop="20261103150000 +0000" channel="SN1"><title lang="en">NBA Basketball</title><sub-title lang="en">Miami Heat at Los Angeles Lakers</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Lakers host the Heat in NBA regular-season play at crypto.com Arena. Los Angeles have won three straight meetings against Miami, including a 134-126 road win in March, while Miami broke a four-game skid with a 129-117 win against Atlanta.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Basketball</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191276_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261103150000 +0000" stop="20261103170000 +0000" channel="SN1"><title lang="en">NBA Basketball</title><sub-title lang="en">Brooklyn Nets at New York Knicks</sub-title><desc lang="en">The New York Knicks host the Brooklyn Nets in an NBA regular-season game at Madison Square Garden. New York has won all five of its most recent meetings with Brooklyn, highlighted by a dramatic 93-92 victory across town at Barclays Center last March.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Basketball</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191276_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261103170000 +0000" stop="20261103190000 +0000" channel="SN1"><title lang="en">NBA Basketball</title><sub-title lang="en">Chicago Bulls at Philadelphia 76ers</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Philadelphia 76ers host the Chicago Bulls in NBA regular-season play at Xfinity Mobile Arena. Chicago have won four of the last five meetings between these two Eastern Conference sides, with Philadelphia&apos;s lone win a 157-137 blowout in March.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Basketball</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191276_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
